From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Unicorn TV Focus Project
Date: Mon, 1 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add framework focus interfaces for D-pad focus overlay

Add the framework-side contract classes that ViewRootImpl references
in patch 0001. These interfaces live in the bootclasspath (framework.jar)
and are implemented by the replaceable policy jar loaded at runtime.

Also adds PackageFilter, a framework-side class that reads a plain-text package
list and decides whether the focus policy should be loaded for a given window.
ViewRootImpl calls this BEFORE instantiating the policy -- non-listed apps get
zero overhead. It also owns the Compose a11y-force decision (isA11yForced) and
the cached dummy AccessibilityServiceInfo list used by the AccessibilityManager
hook in patch 0002.

Apply BEFORE patch 0001-ViewRootImpl-dpad-focus-policy-hooks.patch.

